sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant IO as IoLoop / IoLoopV2
    participant CF as ConnectionFlow
    participant AF as V1 AsyncFiber
    participant SV as Service
    participant H as HandleRequests
    participant LI as ListenerInterface
    participant S as FiberSocket
    participant L as thread-local intrusive list

    IO-->>CF: EOF / error / parse ERROR / close request
    CF->>CF: conn_closing=true, phase=SHUTTING_DOWN
    CF->>AF: notify + JoinIfNeeded
    CF->>CF: phase=PRECLOSE, DrainConnectionQueues
    CF->>SV: OnConnectionClose(ConnectionContext)
    SV->>SV: unsubscribe / unwatch / monitor / tracking cleanup
    CF->>S: V2 ResetOnRecvHook
    opt protocol error
      CF->>S: 写 protocol error
      CF->>S: Shutdown(SHUT_WR)
      CF->>S: drain received bytes until peer closes
    end
    CF-->>H: return
    H->>H: CancelOnErrorCb, destroy reply/parser queue/context
    H-->>LI: RunSingleConnection continues
    LI->>S: Shutdown(SHUT_RDWR) + Close
    LI->>L: Unlink(Connection)
    LI->>LI: intrusive guard.reset
    LI->>LI: open_connections_--
